SDL-E1059 (spec/user.md)

  x invalid SCRAM verifier: the `'[REDACTED]'` sentinel is INFO's redaction — a PASSSCRAM verifier never round-trips; author the real value
   ,----
 1 | user u { on: root; passscram: '[REDACTED]'; };
   :                    ^^^^^^|^^^^^^
   :                          `-- not a valid SCRAM verifier
   `----
  help: a passscram verifier is `SCRAM-SHA-256$<iterations>:<salt>$<stored key>:<server key>` with base64 parts (the engine's parser validates the shape too)
